      "highlights": "• Led the design and development of distributed services for a cloud-based operations platform using Python, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, and AWS.\n• Designed an event-driven processing architecture that reduced coupling between core services and improved application scalability.\n• Improved API performance through database query optimization and targeted caching, reducing p95 response times by more than 50%.\n• Standardized CI/CD, automated testing, and observability patterns across multiple services.\n• Mentored engineers through code reviews, design discussions, and production troubleshooting.",
