      "highlights": "• Developed backend services and REST APIs for a multi-tenant SaaS application using Python, Node.js, PostgreSQL, and AWS.\n• Helped separate tightly coupled application components into independently deployable services with clearer API and data ownership boundaries.\n• Redesigned high-volume database queries and indexes, reducing report generation times by approximately 70%.\n• Expanded automated integration testing and CI validation to improve release reliability.\n• Participated in architecture reviews, incident response, and technical planning for new product capabilities.",
      "enabled": true
    },
